@startuml 任务启动和分发（第二部分）

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 50

participant "EventBus" as EventBus
participant "FireWorker" as Worker
participant "TaskStartHandler" as Handler
participant "TaskSubmittedAction" as Action
participant "DispatchQueue" as Queue
participant "DB" as DB

== 任务启动 ==

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: TaskStartLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
Handler -> Handler: initializeFirstRunTaskInstance()
Handler -> DB: insert(taskInstance)
DB --> Handler: 返回 taskInstanceId

Handler -> Handler: 选择 TaskSubmittedStateAction
Handler -> Action: startEventAction(...)

Action -> Action: tryToDispatchTask()
Action -> EventBus: publish(TaskDispatchLifecycleEvent)

== 任务分发 ==

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: TaskDispatchLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Action: dispatchEventAction(...)
Action -> DB: updateById(状态: SUBMITTED_SUCCESS)
Action -> Queue: dispatchTaskExecuteRunnableWithDelay()
Queue -> Queue: 任务入队

Action --> Worker: 处理完成

@enduml
